      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What problem is this trying to address? Automatic assignment of roles/permissions based on age verification? The lack of a role permission to enforce Age Gated group instances only?\n\nGroups can create roles with permissions, e.g. restrict member access to creating or joining instances. Group post visibility can be limited to certain roles.\n\nAs a group owner, if someone wants to join my private group by invite, the new member can be assigned a role to allow reading the group posts, subscribe to events notifications and learn more about the group without discrimination to age or verification status, but they can't create or join Age Gated instances if and until the member is verified 18+. The door to join the Age Gated instances stays open for the member once they get verified.\n\nThere's also the plausibility that a member can lose their Verified 18+ status after requesting personal data deletion from VRChat, a member could choose to hide it in their profile (but still join 18+ Verified instances), or other reasons, so the roles / permissions system is more flexible than checking it once at the time of joining.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
