      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additionally, [VRChat 2026.1.1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202611) patch notes state Group Automatic Invites may be sent out to users who spend a long enough period of time in that group's instances. If all your group instances are Age Gated, and OP has a desire to have \"18+ age verified only\" for membership, but you can only be automatically invited by being Age Gated (18+ Verified) instances in this case, what problem is this trying to solve?\n\nSorry if I've missed something obvious.",
